{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36349","headline":"嘉兴县内池阁 · 方干","name":"嘉兴县内池阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"指画应心成，周回气象清。\n牀前沙鸟语，案下锦鳞惊。\n细柳风吹旋，新荷露压倾。\n微芳缘岸落，迸笋入波生。\n舴艋舟中醉，莓苔径上行。\n高人莫归去，此处胜蓬瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}